    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is this place? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What is its purpose? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why are you here?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THE DREAMER</i></strong><i> lies until the work is completed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prismania</strong> is a surreal puzzle adventure game. After waking up in a strange triangle-shaped well full of strange mechanisms, you must solve prism puzzles to escape and figure out how you ended up there and what's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/dbd89bc750645375b0499dd4a5e1eb60.poster.avif?t=1745573605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/dbd89bc750645375b0499dd4a5e1eb60.webm?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/dbd89bc750645375b0499dd4a5e1eb60.mp4?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move laser beams</strong> in dozens of boards with increasingly complex prism and modifier pieces. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the well in which you are trapped while you discover <strong>cryptic surreal videos</strong> that will give a new perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Videos, environment and boards. Everything is connected to provide <strong>complex and interesting puzzles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative without texts or dialogues</strong>. Interpret the facts and find out what is going on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/44d96898d0add432f24b48623b325c28.poster.avif?t=1745573605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/44d96898d0add432f24b48623b325c28.webm?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/44d96898d0add432f24b48623b325c28.mp4?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/5511303f6246993f908145cbed431655.poster.avif?t=1745573605\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/5511303f6246993f908145cbed431655.webm?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542240/extras/5511303f6246993f908145cbed431655.mp4?t=1745573605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
